cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vv: universal genomic file viewer"
message: >-
  If you use this software in a publication, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Balwierz
    given-names: Piotr
    orcid: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/balwierz/vv"
url: "https://github.com/balwierz/vv"
abstract: >-
  vv is a fast command-line viewer for tabular and bioinformatics file
  formats: Parquet, Arrow IPC, Feather, BAM/CRAM/SAM, VCF/BCF, BED, GFF,
  GTF, FASTA, FASTQ, plus CSV and TSV. It supports tabix-indexed range
  queries, multi-threaded I/O, and an interactive ncurses table viewer.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - genomics
  - parquet
  - vcf
  - bam
  - bed
  - fasta
  - fastq
  - tabix
  - cli
  - viewer
license: MIT
version: "1.17.0"
date-released: "2026-08-01"
